title Code: environment repo, infrastructure, tests, tooling and records (§6.1, §6.2; git ls-files, 2026-09-24)

*:<b>basic-environment-octopus-codefresh/</b>
private; branch main takes pull requests with
CODEOWNERS review and codefresh/env-checks; <<root>>
**:<b>terraform/</b>
Azure layers
<size:11>read by <color:$C_OCTOPUS>Octopus</color> runbooks</size>
<size:11>and the provisioner</size>;
***:<b>foundation/</b>
the provisioner: groups, registry,
identities, every grant, budgets; <<sec>>
***:<b>build/</b>
the provisioner:
aks-platform-build; <<sec>>
***:<b>tier/</b>
env-* runbooks as
id-platform-lifecycle-<tier>
<size:10><tier>.tfvars committed</size>;
***:<b>apps/descriptor/</b>
module: reads apps/<app>.yaml;
***:<b>apps/tier/</b>
apps-apply runbook;
***:<b>apps/grants/</b>
the provisioner,
Azure access only; <<sec>>
**:<b>tools/</b>
<size:11>run by the operator</size>
<size:11>and <color:$C_CODEFRESH>env-checks</color></size>;
***:<b>Platform.Onboarding/</b>
.NET 10 console: new, scaffold,
render, check, list, retire;
***:<b>Platform.Onboarding.Tests/</b>
unit tests of the kit;
**:<b>tests/</b>
.NET conformance harness
<size:11>run by <color:$C_CODEFRESH>Codefresh</color></size>;
***:<b>Platform.Conformance.sln</b>
platform.settings.json;
***:<b>.Harness/</b>
clients, [Capability],
settings, catalogue loader;
***:<b>.Offline/</b>
Azure, Codefresh, GitOps,
Harness, Kit, Octopus, Report;
***:<b>.Tests/</b>
Azure, Codefresh, GitOps,
Kit, Octopus, Smoke;
***:<b>.Report/</b>
TRX to Markdown and JSON,
render-catalogue;
**:<b>catalogue/</b>
capabilities.d/<area>.yaml:
harness, codefresh, octopus,
gitops, azure, kit
<size:11>read by the harness</size>;
**:<b>contracts/</b>
platform-contracts.yaml:
names, handshake,
descriptors, starters
<size:11>read by the checks</size>;
**:<b>scripts/</b>
<size:11>run by <color:$C_CODEFRESH>env-checks</color></size>;
***:<b>checks/</b>
validate-all.ps1 runs every check,
and the tool-boundary and contract
rules run as offline tests;
***:<b>diagrams/</b>
render.ps1, check.ps1;
**:<b>fixtures/</b>
sandbox-app/: .NET 10
minimal API, the seed
of <sandbox-app-repo>;
**:<b>docs/</b>
guides for people;
***:<b>bootstrap, onboarding</b>
tool-boundaries, scripting,
previews, cutover, notes;
***:<b>capabilities.md</b>
rendered from catalogue/;
***:<b>runbooks/</b>
seven procedures;
***:<b>walkthroughs/</b>
labs 01 to 07;
***:<b>owner/</b>
Grant-ProvisionerRights.ps1; <<sec>>
**:<b>design/</b>
the record;
***:<b>platform-design.md</b>
this design;
***:<b>debate/, multi-app/</b>
memos and fact check;
***:<b>diagrams/</b>
PlantUML and PNG;
**:<b>root files</b>
README.md, CODEOWNERS,
.yamllint.yaml,
PSScriptAnalyzerSettings.psd1;
***:<b>.gitleaks.toml</b>
secret scan rules; <<sec>>

legend right
